           Cell["CalcHEP precision replay (optional)", "Subsubsection"],
           Cell["The default CalcHEP comparison above retains its raw \
residuals. This separate replay uses the same saved phase-space points and \
CalcHEP expressions. With 113 mantissa bits, all 1000 points agree at the \
unchanged tolerance. This behavior is consistent with roundoff in \
cancellations at ordinary precision. The native and GCC53 controls remain \
visible below. Run this optional cell for a fresh replay; each run keeps its \
own output directory.", "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5ZZhhhPrecisionD\
irectory = FileNameJoin[{hepcatDirectory, \"tests\", \"results\", \
\"SM-5-point\", \"precision\", \"ZZhhh-replay\",\n  DateString[{\"Year\", \
\"Month\", \"Day\", \"-\", \"Hour\", \"Minute\", \
\"Second\"}]}];\nsm5ZZhhhPrecisionRun = RunProcess[{\n  \"python3\",\n  \
FileNameJoin[{hepcatDirectory, \"tests\", \"SM-5-point\", \
\"replay-calchep-precision.py\"}],\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \
\"ZZhhh\"}],\n  \"--points-csv\", FileNameJoin[{hepcatDirectory, \"tests\", \
\"results\", \"SM-5-point\", \"precision\", \"ZZhhh-default\", \
\"points.csv\"}],\n  \"--seed\", \"1794439435781037000\",\n  \"--output\", \
sm5ZZhhhPrecisionDirectory}];\nsm5ZZhhhPrecisionSummaryFile = \
FileNameJoin[{sm5ZZhhhPrecisionDirectory, \
\"precision-summary.json\"}];\nIf[FileExistsQ[sm5ZZhhhPrecisionSummaryFile],\
\n  sm5ZZhhhPrecisionReport = Import[sm5ZZhhhPrecisionSummaryFile, \
\"RawJSON\"];\n  Dataset[Table[\n    Join[<|\"Evaluation\" -> name|>, \
KeyTake[sm5ZZhhhPrecisionReport[\"Results\"][name],\n      {\"MantissaBits\", \
\"Points\", \"Mismatches\", \"Errors\", \"MaximumRelativeError\", \
\"Status\"}]],\n    {name, {\"Native\", \"GCC53\", \"GCC128\"}}]],\n  \
sm5ZZhhhPrecisionRun]", "Input", CellTags ->
