helicity family. It builds SPINAS and compares the squared amplitudes with \
CalcHEP and MadGraph at 1000 phase-space points each. The complete reports \
and random seeds remain in the Export variable.", "Text"],
           Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5uUhhhExport = WriteSPINASProcess[\n  \
